  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(17)³ + (7)³ / (17)² + (7)² - x = 24\n\n**Formula used:**\n\na³ + b³ = (a + b)(a² - ab + b²)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(17)³ + (7)³ = (17 + 7)((17)² - 17 × 7 + (7)²)\n\n⇒ (17 + 7)((17)² - 17 × 7 + (7)²) / (17)² + (7)² - x = 24\n\n⇒ 24 × (17)² + 24 × (7)² - 24x = (17)³ + (7)³\n\n⇒ 24 × 289 + 24 × 49 - 24x = 4913 + 343\n\n⇒ 6936 + 1176 - 24x = 5256\n\n⇒ 8112 - 24x = 5256\n\n⇒ 24x = 8112 - 5256\n\n⇒ 24x = 2856\n\n⇒ x = 2856 / 24\n\n⇒ x = 119\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (4).**",
